      "title": "Limits of the Classical Model",
      "gist": "Cognition needs fast flexible control that fixed synaptic wiring and specialized neurons cannot explain, but neurons that carry mixed signals point toward a wave-based mechanism.",
      "question": "Classical model — why can't fixed synapses and specialized neurons explain flexible cognition? (a critique)"
    },
