      "title": "Spatial Computing",
      "gist": "Alpha/beta waves lay spatial patterns like stencils over cortex that decide where spiking can appear, explaining mixed selectivity and population-level coding.",
      "question": "Spatial Computing — how can patterned waves flexibly control which neurons express information? (a theory)"
